	<section_number>60.2-605</section_number>
	<catch_line>Benefit rights based on benefit year</catch_line>
	<text>
		Benefit rights of individuals shall be based solely upon the benefit year as defined in § 60.2-206.
	</text>
	<history>Code 1950, § 60-44; 1960, c. 136; 1968, c. 738, § 60.1-49; 1986, c. 480.</history>
